<title>HUNGARY: Hungary's Aranypok boosts profits in 1996.</title>
<headline>Hungary's Aranypok boosts profits in 1996.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of forints unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit	    109.5    vs     78.0</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		 80.4    vs     58.3</p>
<p>    After-tax profit	     61.9    vs     42.9</p>
<p>    Net sales revenue	 1,723.8    vs  1,353.6</p>
<p>    Other revenue		  38.1    vs     20.8</p>
<p>    Direct costs of sales   1,396.0    vs  1,110.2</p>
<p>    Indirect costs of sales   162.3    vs    140.2</p>
<p>    Other expenditures	   94.0    vs     46.0</p>
<p>    Net financial income	 24.9 loss vs   14.9 loss</p>
<p>	Financial revenue	   2.3    vs	2.0</p>
<p>	Financial expenditure    27.3    vs     16.9</p>
<p>    Net extraordinary income    4.1 loss vs    4.8 loss</p>
<p>	Extraordinary revenue     0.0    vs	0.08</p>
<p>	Extraordinary expend.     4.1    vs	4.8</p>
<p>    Taxation			 18.5    vs     15.4</p>
<p>NOTE - Aranypok Kereskedelmi Rt clothing retailer. The company said the figures were prepared in accordance with Hungarian Accounting Standards.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
